          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Gunbird uses anime-styled character as the player's chosen craft. A story plays out in between levels and before boss fights, telling a tale of how the protagonists are trying to collect pieces of a magic mirror to make a wish.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Gunbird presenta personajes de estilo anime como la figura que controla el jugador. Entre niveles y antes de los combates contra los jefes se desarrolla una historia que narra cómo los protagonistas intentan reunir los fragmentos de un espejo mágico para pedir un deseo.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "1994",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
